WEBVTT

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.458
that we built in Mississauga,
a city outside Toronto.

00:03:02.792 --> 00:03:05.518
And people call this
Marilyn Monroe Towers --

00:03:05.542 --> 00:03:06.601
(Laughter)

00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:08.625
because of its curvature.

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:13.434
And the idea was to build a tower,

00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:18.268
high-rise, residential tower,
but not a box.

00:03:18.292 --> 00:03:20.101
It's more inspired by nature,

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.917
with the sunshine and wind dynamics.

00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:28.917
After we finished
designing the first tower,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.601
they told us, you know,